  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "くびに　ついた　どくその　くさりでぜんしんの　きんにくが　しげきされたくましい　からだに　へんぼうした。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "목에 달린 독소로 된 사슬에 의해 온몸의 근육이 자극을 받아 듬직한 체격으로 변했다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "脖子上的毒素鎖鏈刺激了全身的肌肉，使牠的身體變得壯碩。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les toxines de la chaîne empoisonnée autour de son cou ont stimulé tous ses muscles et son corps est devenu massif.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Giftstoffe aus der Kette um seinen Hals haben all seine Muskeln stimuliert und ihm einen kräftigen Körper verliehen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Las toxinas de la cadena que lleva al cuello producen una estimulación muscular que le ha conferido un cuerpo de lo más robusto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le tossine della catena che porta al collo ne hanno stimolato i muscoli, rendendo poderoso il suo fisico.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "After all its muscles were stimulated by the toxic chain around its neck, Okidogi transformed and gained a powerful physique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "首に　ついた　毒素の　鎖で全身の　筋肉が　刺激されたくましい　体に　変貌した。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "脖子上的毒素锁链刺激了全身的肌肉，让身体变得更为强壮。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Las toxinas de la cadena que lleva al cuello producen una estimulación muscular que le ha conferido un cuerpo de lo más robusto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "すぐ　あたまに　ちが　のぼってしまうあらくれもの。　くびの　くさりをふりまわし　なんでも　たたきつぶす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "쉽게 흥분해 버리는 난폭한 녀석. 목에 달린 사슬을 휘두르며 닥치는 대로 때려 부순다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "動不動就會怒火沖天的粗暴傢伙。會揮甩脖子的鎖鏈一股腦兒地擊碎東西。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon violent a le sang qui lui monte facilement à la tête. Il détruit tout sur son passage en faisant tourner la chaîne autour de son cou.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Diesem ungehobelten Pokémon steigt das Blut schnell zu Kopf. Es schwingt die Kette an seinem Hals, um alles zu zerstören.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon violento al que se le sube la sangre a la cabeza enseguida. Hace girar en círculos la cadena que lleva al cuello para golpearlo todo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon rissoso a cui va subito il sangue alla testa. Distrugge qualunque cosa facendo roteare la catena che porta al collo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Okidogi is a ruffian with a short temper. It can pulverize anything by swinging around the chain on its neck.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "すぐ　頭に　血が　上ってしまう荒くれもの。　首の　鎖を振り回し　なんでも　叩き潰す。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "很容易失去冷静的粗暴家伙。会甩动脖子上的锁链击碎一切。",
